# Conventions for ADRs

- Number ADRs sequentially with 4-digit prefixes (like `0001-architecture-principles.md`)
- Use [MADR v3](https://adr.github.io/madr/) format, adapted for project Markdown conventions
- Use dash (`-`) list markers (per rumdl MD004), not `*` as in upstream MADR
- Include YAML frontmatter with `status` and `date` fields
- Valid status values: `proposed`, `accepted`, `deprecated`, `superseded`
